      "content": "so you're saying it wasn't really about democracy or societal progress, just a specific group of workers getting better deals? that feels like a pretty narrow way to look at it. isn't it kind of ironic to say it didn't impact society when the very structure of our work week and our social safety nets came from these movements? it seems like you're downplaying how fundamental these changes were to our modern life.",
